# The kinds present

A package's kind, declared in its workshop.toml, decides its template, its tools and the gate phases that apply to it:

- cpp-conan (packages/lib): derives from nothing; gate phases build, format, lint, test
- python (packages/echo): derives from nothing; gate phases examples, format, lint, test, typecheck
- python-nanobind (packages/native): derives from python; gate phases examples, format, lint, test, typecheck
